+// night lab GROUPED, per layer: night_grouped_f16 decodes types 16 17 18 20 21 22 42 (night_grouped.hpp); a layer with
+// any other gate/up or down type (Flash-Next GSQ-RCO's layer 47 is IQ4_XS gate/up) keeps dequant + oneMKL for all its
